    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Salutes you.:: We're good here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Вітає вас.:: Тут все гаразд.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We're good here, enforcer.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тут все гаразд, виконавче.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Lazy zoners want stuff. Our stuff.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ліниві зонери чогось хочуть. Наших речей.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>These people stink.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ці люди смердять.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's the usual: "We're starving, we're being zoned out, we need medication..." Yeah.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Звичне: "Ми голодуємо, нас витісняють із зон, нам потрібні ліки..." Ага.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Do not touch them. Or let them touch you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не торкайтеся їх. І не дозволяйте їм торкатися вас.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Damn these zoners - I'm going to miss the match!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чорт забирай цих зонерів - я пропущу матч!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Sighs.:: What's wrong with these people? Back to the Zone, you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Зітхає.:: Що з цими людьми не так? Повертайтеся в Зону, ви.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>"Rights"! ::He laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">"Права"! ::Він сміється.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The guy with the sledge, though...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хлопець з кувалдою, хоча...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Get back to your barrel soups, zoners.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Повертайтеся до своїх супів з бочок, зонери.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
